      "settings": {
        "heading": "Then a friend said the thing that stuck",
        "body": "<p>What I did grow up with was the complaint. Everyone around me agreed that the chai in American coffee shops was nothing like the real thing. I knew it. It just never occurred to me that it was mine to fix.</p><p>Then a friend who'd grown up in Mumbai, here for his master's, said it plainly one afternoon: <em>“Man, I'm craving chai, and there's nowhere I can get it.”</em></p><p>That was the call to action. What I still didn't have was the reason.</p>",
